; GraphEdit with its minimap off. `_minimap_draw` returns at once when the minimap is disabled
; (graph_edit.cpp:1808-1810), and the panel is hidden (:2884-2890). The constructor presses the
; toggle from the member `show_grid` before any property applies (:3311), so the default is on
; and no other GraphEdit fixture can catch a renderer that ignores the property.

